{"title":"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/4/72407d60ed4af9e6f11ee6a17f0f859b5abd883a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {35x - 29}{x^2 - 3x + 2} = \\frac {N_1}{x - 1} + \\frac {N_2}{x - 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"231\" height=\"39\" /> be an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Identity\" title=\"Identity\">identity</a> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. The numerical value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/f/abfd2c5e947947f963baed24a3577117ed03c0cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N_1N_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"17\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66df6cd52353ed656ef1de482d3d82d42bf4ffb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ - 246 \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ - 210 \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ - 29 \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ 210 \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ 246$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"478\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62e16029d6419ab797d5efc7de5e8620a0ecf079.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac {N_1}{x - 1} + \\frac {N_2}{x - 2} = \\frac{N_1(x-2) + N_2(x-1)}{(x-1)(x-2)} = \\frac{(N_1 + N_2)x - (2N_1 + N_2)}{x^2 - 3x + 2}\\]\" width=\"539\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Comparing <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Coefficient\" title=\"Coefficient\">coefficients</a>, we have the system of two equations\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/b/aabdb091b34a0e4260f43beee10a6700935487ea.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} N_1 + N_2 &amp;= 35\\\\ N_1 + 2N_2 &amp;= 29 \\end{align*}\" width=\"116\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Subtracting the first equation from the second yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/9/f39ec7d130dc4e927f47e50bf9f4571be22cb859.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N_2 = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />. Substituting yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/1/471c79310cc5875616559b3510b27695ec269a52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N_1 = 41$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" />, and their product is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/6/ba65c1e578b6683dfc9cd49ccb19a1ea6793735f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-246 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME\" title=\"1966 AHSME\">1966 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1966 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1966\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1966_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1966 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/i